flowchart TD
    A[Start: Retail query requirement] --> B[Define business rule and expected result]
    B --> C[Prepare representative dataset]
    C --> D[Run baseline SQL query]
    D --> E[EXPLAIN ANALYZE + BUFFERS]
    E --> F[Identify bottleneck: scan, join, sort, filter, I/O]
    F --> G{Choose evidence-based change}
    G --> H[Create suitable index]
    G --> I[Rewrite non-sargable or over-wide query]
    G --> J[Evaluate partitioning for large time-based tables]
    H --> K[ANALYZE and rerun same query]
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K --> L[Capture execution plan and median runtime]
    L --> M{Correct result and measurable benefit?}
    M -- No --> N[Review plan, remove/revise change]
    N --> F
    M -- Yes --> O[Document before/after metrics and trade-offs]
    O --> P[Recommendations and final report]
